WEBVTT

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:06.150
Garapushka, fire!

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.660
Enemy battle group, 51% are downed

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:14.700
or destroyed.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.660
We did it.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.620
What's happening out there?

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.130
We'll clean up the remaining enemy forces.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.710
Follow me!

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.300
Let's go, Hina. Let's kill Watase Aoba!

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.900
Glory to Zogilia.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:52.860
Attack units have broken through the enemy's front line!

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.850
Garapushka, prepare for a second shot!

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:56.910
A second shot?

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:59.240
That wasn't part of the plan!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.080
<i>I'm</i> the commander here.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.040
The enemy has broken through our front lines!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.120
Assemble all remaining forces!

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.760
Our forces still exceed theirs.

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.760
Don't let that cannon fire a second shot!

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:18.890
The Fleet ordered all aerial units to incapacitate the Gorgon.

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:22.100
They're ordering us to charge straight into the enemy's base under these conditions?

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:23.140
What should we do?

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:28.350
An order is an order. We have no choice.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:29.900
Understood.

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.360
Full speed ahead!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.840
The fate of the battle rests in your hands.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.240
We're counting on you, Dio, Aoba-kun.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:42.330
However, you guys are not allowed to use these mecha's Coupling System.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:45.290
I've programmed both of your coordination data into them.

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:48.120
The mecha is different. However, the cockpit's still the same.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.170
Good luck.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:50.460
Follow my lead.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.590
Don't lag behind!

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:52.670
Understood.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:01:59.430
A second shot?

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.430
In 15 minutes.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:04.180
That idiot. He got carried away by its sheer power.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:08.060
But if we fired a second shot,
we'd have the upper hand.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:13.320
Do you think a weapon that can destroy a city and a fleet can be fired endlessly?!

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:18.820
Garapushka's energy source is the Nectoribium itself.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:26.330
A single shot consumes a year's worth of Zogilia's Nectoribium mining.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.500
Seriously?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.870
A year's worth? Is that true?

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:33.290
It's no use winning a fight if the country perishes as a result.

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.300
<i>Yet...</i>

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:39.260
<i>I, Alfried Gallant, was the one who
persuaded him to fire the first shot.</i>

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.470
Lieutenant Colonel?

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:41.430
Let's go!

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.970
Attack while the enemy is in chaos and aim for victory.

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:45.850
Roger!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.200
Glory to Zogilia.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:11.460
Zogilian forces are engaged in the front line.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.960
This isn't the time to be worrying about the Gorgon.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.880
Launch the Valiancer units!

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:18.760
We're suddenly thrown into the fierce battle, huh?

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.470
Quit complaining, Jarl.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:21.340
Let's go!

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:22.260
Roger.
Got it.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.940
Dammit, we can't advance!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.730
The enemy forces are increasing!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.030
I'm going to break through.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.190
Follow me!

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.280
There's no need to, Lieutenant Colonel.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:42.950
Bizon?

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.370
Hina and I will hunt them down.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:49.080
Hina, come on. Let's perform a Coupling.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.000
Understood.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.960
Doctor, we're in your hands.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.870
Everything is a "go".

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.590
Connect with Hina!

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.340
Acc—

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:02.680
What are you doing, Hina? Say "Accept".

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:06.700
What a troublesome kid.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.600
Sorry. That was my fault.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:17.110
I've already gotten rid of the error. It's all okay.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:18.520
Be careful.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.030
What would you do if my Hina got hurt?

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.110
I apologize.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:24.820
Let's do this. Connect with Hina!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.000
Hina!

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.510
Now, show them what you can do.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:53.350
Glory to Zogilia.

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:12.120
Indifa and Inflex's Valiancer units are destroyed!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.580
Two enemy Valiancer's codewave confirmed.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.040
They're Coupling mechas!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.120
What did you say?!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.790
Don't tell me there are Couplers on their side...

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.760
Look, Hina!

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.760
This is our power!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:28.640
Bizon...

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.010
What happened to him?

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:32.220
But it's incredible.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.770
Don't let this chance slip by.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:34.580
Let's go!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.480
It's the white swan, Hina!

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.900
Aoba came all the way here for us!

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.110
You're in the way!

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.740
Get lost!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:49.990
He's too fast!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.620
There's no way we can beat a Coupling mecha.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:53.830
Oh no! The Cygnus!

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.080
Nectar cannon on the left wing has been hit!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.170
The float engine has been damaged!

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:08.180
Performance dropped by 40%!

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:11.390
30 seconds until the Nectar Curtain's ready!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:14.100
Begone!

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:20.020
What?!

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.990
Luxon Next and Bradyon Next!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.450
Aoba-san!

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:29.450
Phew.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.450
Finally.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:31.950
A Nectar Rifle?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.740
Unable to identify mechas.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:35.240
A new-type?

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:36.660
Let's do this, Dio!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.250
Don't order me around!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.000
Connect with Dio!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.250
Accept.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.050
A hero's entrance!

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.970
Man, you guys are late!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.220
Seriously.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.650
Coupling mechas?

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.400
The Alliance's new-type Coupling mechas.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.860
The pilots are probably...

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.660
Watase Aoba!

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.740
Aoba?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:19.910
Those Valiancers are...

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.920
The ones you saw in the past?

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:25.880
Yeah. The one that came to kill me and the one Hina piloted.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.090
Don't tell me...

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.960
Let's do it, Hina!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.550
Hina's piloting that mecha?!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:33.760
They're coming!

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.690
What's with those new-types?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.900
Amazing!

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:47.610
So that's a battle between Coupling mechas, huh?

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.940
Emphater level is at 90%!

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:52.030
The highest matching so far!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:56.950
I can't believe I'm already watching
a battle between Coupling mechas.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:59.160
Valuable data can be obtained from this.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.700
This is...!

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:02.920
Elvira-san, please take a look at this.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:03.920
What's this?

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.590
Anyway, the enemy has lost the advantage now.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:10.550
Attack with everything you got!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:11.970
This is the deciding battle!

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.140
Our units have been damaged.

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.850
We've lost our advantage from the surprise attack...

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:27.310
To think we depended on the Coupling mechas as well.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:28.980
Dammit.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:29.780
They're strong!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:30.730
Aoba!

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:33.990
If you've no intention of shooting them down,
you'll be the one getting shot down!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:36.200
I know that! But...

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:37.620
Both of you, listen up.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.330
There's a strange noise, so we analyzed it.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.040
It seems that there's something
unusual in the enemy's Coupling.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.790
It may have been forced.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:48.790
If that's the case, there's a chance we can defeat them.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.050
So I have a plan.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.430
I see. This is a bet.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.300
A very dangerous one, too.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.810
Let me do it!

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:01.430
I'm sure Hina is piloting it.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.270
All right.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:08.230
Let's go, Aoba!

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:08.980
Yeah!

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.400
Decoupling!
Decoupling!

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.400
They deactivated their Coupling?

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.080
Hina, can you hear me?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.080
It's me!

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:28.330
Eh?

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.750
What the...?

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:30.090
Dammit!

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:32.090
I didn't know this cockpit had such a function!

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.470
What?

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.430
Hina! It's Aoba!

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.470
Aoba?

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:42.640
Yes. Aoba.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.180
Aoba.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.020
It's me. Watase Aoba!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.400
You are who you are, right?

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:59.030
Aoba!

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:00.780
Hina!

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:11.590
They've forcefully done a Decoupling!

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.420
Now's our chance!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.340
Okay!

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:23.850
Damn you!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.770
What did you do, Aoba?!

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:33.110
Dio, Aoba-kun, the Gorgon's already preparing to fire a second shot.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.360
Estimated 4 minutes before it fires.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:36.400
We're running out of time!

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.650
Understood.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.930
Let's go, Aoba!

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:39.740
Got it!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.500
3 minutes until firing.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:49.710
Please wait! Our soldiers are still in the battlefield!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.580
Everybody has been notified.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.210
We'll be firing as planned.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.750
I understand.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.010
Three Valiancer units approaching rapidly.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.600
You awake, Hina?

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:06.770
Aoba.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:09.690
I never thought you'd be a Coupler.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.480
I don't quite understand.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:15.360
I thought I declined Dr. Hahn's offer.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.820
What does that mean?

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.690
I don't know the details,

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:21.070
but he'll use any means to get what he wants.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:24.570
What are you doing to my Hina?!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.540
Hina, are you okay?!

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.420
Let's perform a Coupling once more!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.790
Stop it, Bizon!

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:35.960
They're coming!

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.100
We must hurry!

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:40.420
Connect with Hina!

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.590
No!

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.140
What's wrong, Hina?!

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:46.970
Are you okay?!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.560
Answer me, Hina.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:49.730
Hina!

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.480
Stop it!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:54.020
The noise is coming from the enemies.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:54.980
I knew it.

00:11:55.320 --> 00:12:00.360
Hahn, you've succeeded in making the Coupling possible without the Couplers' will.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:04.240
Those who are trapped within the stereotype are wrong.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:07.700
At this rate, the enemy will go through Forced Coupling again.

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.960
Hina, let's perform a Coupling together.

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:14.370
What?

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:16.040
Don't worry, Hina.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.500
Trust me!

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:19.250
Aoba.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.320
Hina!

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:23.510
Connect with Hina!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.220
Do it, Aoba!

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:27.470
Connect with Hina!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.770
Emphater level increasing!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.360
No signs of stopping!

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:41.030
What's happening, Aoba-kun?!

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:43.360
Ensign Ryazan.

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:55.770
Aoba.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.330
Hina.

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:03.340
At first, I hated you.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.180
I know.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:09.850
However, you've always believed in me.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:17.370
This time, it's my turn to believe in you, Aoba.

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.440
Accept.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:34.830
Aoba...

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.920
Why, Hina?!

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:41.920
Why?!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.920
What's happening?!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.630
What is that light?!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:46.930
I-I don't know!

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:49.430
Garapushka, fire!

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:27.650
Singularity of unknown origin has
appeared at coordinates 125°-979.

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:28.840
It is beginning to expand.

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:32.300
Gravitational anomaly detected.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.560
Evasive maneuvers! Now!

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:37.060
Propulsion problems on Proto-Valiancer Unit 2.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:39.690
At this rate, he'll be pulled in.

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:42.270
What's wrong, Unit 2?!

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.190
Accelerate!

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:43.730
Damn...

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:44.770
Damn it!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.370
Bizon!

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.120
This is the same as before.

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:02.250
What is it?

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:03.630
I told you before.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.710
I went into that and came to this period.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.720
Time Tunnel.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.300
Time Tunnel?

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:14.290
I see. That was what you were talking about?

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.800
Yeah, I'm sure this is it.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.390
It can't be!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.850
Damn you!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.770
I won't forgive you!

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:25.520
Watase Aoba!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.230
You were the one who brought me here.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:32.070
I was attacked by a Valiancer at school

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:34.570
and you were the one that rescued me.

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:39.130
Aoba will be attacked...

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:43.460
The Time Tunnel...

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:48.960
I see.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:51.420
Hina!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:51.930
What's wrong?

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:55.350
Aoba, it's as you said.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:55.890
What?

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.520
This time, it's my turn to save you!

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:02.770
Wait, Hina!

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:05.520
Stop, Aoba! It's dangerous!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:06.900
Go away, Dio!

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.020
If I don't go now...

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.280
Hina!

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.650
Accelerate!

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.640
We'll meet again, Aoba.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:34.430
Hina!

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:54.880
I...

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:08.040
I wonder when he'll...

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:17.220
It'll be fine. There's still time.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.220
Definitely.

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.490
Wait for me, Aoba.

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:39.120
I get it.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.420
Hina was...

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:45.710
Hina was the only one still living in the same timeline...

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.000
and she saved me...

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:01.010
I...

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:05.120
Who am I?

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:09.770
Hina has been repeating the same thing over and over again.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:13.010
And every time I failed to stop her.

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:15.690
Hina!

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:18.740
Hina!

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:24.990
Aoba, it's as you said.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.500
This time, it's my turn to save you!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.000
Wait, Hina!

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:39.510
Aoba, hurry up!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:40.220
Eh?

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.220
What's wrong?

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.850
You're not stopping me?

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:44.350
Why would I stop you?

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.330
She is "Hina", right?
The one who saved your life?

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:50.150
Ah, I see.

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:52.730
You've seen it as well.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.280
We'll meet again, Aoba.

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:02.910
Hina, don't go!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:03.910
Aoba!

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:04.870
Why?!

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.910
Stop repeating the cycle!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.120
What are you talking about?!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:11.370
If I don't go, Bizon will appear and kill you!

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:12.630
I know!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:16.590
It's no use talking to this guy right now.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.800
Ready, Aoba? Don't let go.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.340
Okay!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:25.810
What are you bastards doing?!

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:27.850
Goodbye.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:33.900
Damn you!

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.480
Aoba!

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.280
Hina!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:03.640
Retreat! Retreat!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.890
What happened to Bizon?!

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.640
Alaska Base has...

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:14.150
This war is far from over.

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:19.070
<i>Is this punishment for those who are attracted to the power of Nectoribium?</i>

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:22.030
The Zogilian army is retreating!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:24.910
Yes!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:27.330
We somehow survived.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.740
This is Dio. We'll be arriving shortly.

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.250
Same goes for Aoba.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:32.620
Aoba-san!

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.820
It's the return of our heroes.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:39.800
Aoba,

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:42.050
why did you stop me?

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.010
Why, you ask?

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.180
I didn't want you to go. That's all.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.220
It was your chance to go back to the past.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:51.850
Why'd you pass it up?

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:53.320
Well...

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:56.600
This guy wasn't thinking.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:57.630
What'd you say?

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:59.980
There will be more chances!

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.320
How optimistic.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.610
Isn't that true?

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:05.820
No one knows the future.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.120
Aoba...

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:12.330
Anyway, there's a certain someone who would feel lonely if I were gone.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.580
Are you talking about me?

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:17.330
Who else would I mean?

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:18.880
You're surprisingly slow.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:19.710
<i>Slo— I don't wanna hear that from you!</i>

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:23.970
That's right. Nobody knows the future.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:33.560
Bradyon Next, Luxon Next,
and a captured mecha will arrive soon.

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:34.350
Understood!

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:37.500
Valiancer units' landing preparations, complete!

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:42.350
With my heart, I call out

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:46.730
To the far side, mutually drawn

00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:51.230
Forgetting even the reason I ache

00:21:51.230 --> 00:21:55.860
Just for now, please

00:21:55.860 --> 00:22:00.030
I know you

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:04.540
I'm searching for you

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:07.000
Softly pressing my lips

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:13.590
to the bright afterimage I can't keep from leaving

00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:22.140
If hesitation is what gives way to the slightest of hopes

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:26.770
To the many gentle mornings...

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:31.310
and the times I have wondered

00:22:31.310 --> 00:22:35.570
In the future that leads back to that sky,

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:37.780
I want to save you,

00:22:37.780 --> 00:22:39.900
I want to protect you

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:44.280
In the future that arrives at that dream

00:22:44.280 --> 00:22:47.160
Wait for me

00:22:47.160 --> 00:22:51.920
The love we'll surely find

00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:56.710
I want you to reach out for it

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:30.160
Finally, the time has come.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:32.800
You have no future.

00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:36.560
Have a taste of my wrath,

00:23:36.940 --> 00:23:39.420
Watase Aoba.
